exports[`the sign-in email > subject, text and HTML 1`] = `
"123456 is your TriviaFoundry sign-in code
---
Your TriviaFoundry sign-in code is 123456

Type it into the sign-in page you started on — that works even if you
are reading this on a different device.

Or open this link and press the button there to sign in:

https://example.test/sign-in/confirm

The code works once and expires in 15 minutes.
If you didn't ask to sign in, you can ignore this email — nobody can
sign in as you without the code above.
---
<p>Your TriviaFoundry sign-in code is:</p><p style="font-size:28px;letter-spacing:6px;font-weight:600">123456</p><p>Type it into the sign-in page you started on — that works even if you are reading this on a different device.</p><p>Or open this link and press the button there to sign in:</p><p><a href="https://example.test/sign-in/confirm">https://example.test/sign-in/confirm</a></p><p>The code works once and expires in 15 minutes.</p><p>If you didn't ask to sign in, you can ignore this email — nobody can sign in as you without the code above.</p>"
`;
